---
source: misc/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"exch\")"
---
Atomically exchange two filesystem paths.

Uses renameat2(2) with the RENAME_EXCHANGE flag. Both paths must exist and be on the same
filesystem.

Usage: exch <PATH1> <PATH2>

Arguments:
  <PATH1>
          First path

  <PATH2>
          Second path

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
